{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57234","headline":"付法颂 · 菩提达摩","name":"付法颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾本来唐国（《景德传灯录》作「兹土」），传教（《景德传灯录》作「法」）救迷情。\n一花开五叶，结果自然成。\n（《南宗顿教最上大乘摩诃般若波罗密经六祖慧能大师於韶州大梵寺施法坛经》）（按：此首亦出唐人依托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}